  "notes": "{仮定|かてい} is used in logical arguments, science, and hypothetical discussions.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]を{仮定|かてい}する\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {仮定|かてい}する (to assume, hypothesize)\n- 〜と{仮定|かてい}する (to assume that ~)\n- {仮定|かてい}の{話|はなし} (hypothetical talk)\n\nGRAMMAR TERM:\n- {仮定|かてい}{形|けい} (conditional form)\n- {仮定|かてい}{法|ほう} (subjunctive mood)\n\nHOMOPHONES:\n- {家庭|かてい} (home, family)\n- {過程|かてい} (process)\n- {課程|かてい} (course, curriculum)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {推測|すいそく}: guess, conjecture\n- {想定|そうてい}: assumption, scenario\n- {前提|ぜんてい}: premise, prerequisite",
